; word-frequency-purify-band.fk — usage is alive; any word walks.
;
; Verdict 8191:
;   1      seed rows still carry their words
;   2      seed rows retain different authored readings and positive coordinates
;   4      admit grows the field; the seed stays referenced
;   8      "gate" common is a guard; purified recognizes
;   16     "law" common is a command; purified is observed
;   32     rest without a named path stays verbatim
;   64     encouragement stays verbatim
;   128    ordinary language stays verbatim
;   256    explicit zero, one and absent coordinates stay distinct
;   512    new drafts keep context without inventing interpretation or coordinates
;   1024   "refuse" stays; the person remains
;   2048   negation remains; all offered rows remain intact
;   4096   axiom word sightings count even in explicit disagreement
;
